        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="标题"><a id="标题" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#标题"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>标题</h2><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="markdown"><code class="language-markdown"># 一级标题## 二级标题### 三级标题#### 四级标题##### 五级标题###### 六级标题</code></pre><p>效果：</p><h2 id="二级标题"><a id="二级标题" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#二级标题"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>二级标题</h2><h3 id="三级标题"><a id="三级标题" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#三级标题"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>三级标题</h3><hr><h1 id="2字体"><a id="2字体" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#2字体"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>2. 字体</h1><h2 id="加粗"><a id="加粗" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#加粗"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>加粗</h2><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="markdown"><code class="language-markdown">**加粗文字**</code></pre><p>效果：</p><p><strong>加粗文字</strong></p><h2 id="斜体"><a id="斜体" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#斜体"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>斜体</h2><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="markdown"><code class="language-markdown">*斜体文字*</code></pre><p>效果：</p><p><em>斜体文字</em></p><h2 id="加粗斜体"><a id="加粗斜体" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#加粗斜体"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>加粗斜体</h2><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="markdown"><code class="language-markdown">***加粗斜体***</code></pre><p>效果：</p><p><em><strong>加粗斜体</strong></em></p><h2 id="删除线"><a id="删除线" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#删除线"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>删除线</h2><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="markdown"><code class="language-markdown">~~删除文字~~</code></pre><p>效果：</p><p><del>删除文字</del></p><hr><h1 id="3分割线"><a id="3分割线" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#3分割线"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>3. 分割线</h1><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="markdown"><code class="language-markdown">---***___</code></pre><p>效果：</p><hr><hr><h1 id="4引用"><a id="4引用" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#4引用"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>4. 引用</h1><h2 id="一级引用"><a id="一级引用" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#一级引用"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>一级引用</h2><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="markdown"><code class="language-markdown">&gt; 这是引用内容</code></pre><p>效果：</p><blockquote><p>这是引用内容</p></blockquote><h2 id="多级引用"><a id="多级引用" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#多级引用"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>多级引用</h2><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="markdown"><code class="language-markdown">&gt; 一级引用&gt;&gt;&gt; 二级引用&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; 三级引用</code></pre><hr><h1 id="5列表"><a id="5列表" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#5列表"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>5. 列表</h1><h2 id="无序列表"><a id="无序列表" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#无序列表"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>无序列表</h2><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="markdown"><code class="language-markdown">- 苹果- 香蕉- 西瓜</code></pre><p>效果：</p><ul><li>苹果</li><li>香蕉</li><li>西瓜</li></ul><h2 id="多级列表"><a id="多级列表" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#多级列表"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>多级列表</h2><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="markdown"><code class="language-markdown">- 一级  - 二级    - 三级</code></pre><h2 id="有序列表"><a id="有序列表" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#有序列表"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>有序列表</h2><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="markdown"><code class="language-markdown">1. 第一项2. 第二项3. 第三项</code></pre><h2 id="混合列表"><a id="混合列表" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#混合列表"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>混合列表</h2><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="markdown"><code class="language-markdown">1. Linux   - Ubuntu   - CentOS2. Windows   - Windows10   - Windows11</code></pre><hr><h1 id="6任务列表"><a id="6任务列表" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#6任务列表"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>6. 任务列表</h1><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="markdown"><code class="language-markdown">- [x] 完成安装- [ ] 配置环境- [ ] 发布博客</code></pre><p>效果：</p><ul><li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" checked="" disabled=""> 完成安装</li><li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" disabled=""> 配置环境</li><li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" disabled=""> 发布博客</li></ul><hr><h1 id="7链接"><a id="7链接" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#7链接"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>7. 链接</h1><h2 id="普通链接"><a id="普通链接" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#普通链接"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>普通链接</h2><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="markdown"><code class="language-markdown">[百度](https://www.baidu.com)</code></pre><h2 id="自动链接"><a id="自动链接" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#自动链接"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>自动链接</h2><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="markdown"><code class="language-markdown">&lt;https://www.baidu.com&gt;</code></pre><hr><h1 id="8图片"><a id="8图片" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#8图片"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>8. 图片</h1><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="markdown"><code class="language-markdown">![图片名称](图片地址)</code></pre><p>示例：</p><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="markdown"><code class="language-markdown">![Markdown](https://markdown-here.com/img/icon256.png)</code></pre><hr><h1 id="9表格"><a id="9表格" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#9表格"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>9. 表格</h1><h2 id="普通表格"><a id="普通表格" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#普通表格"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>普通表格</h2><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="markdown"><code class="language-markdown">| 名称 | 类型 | 描述 || ---- | ---- | ---- || CPU | 硬件 | 处理器 || GPU | 硬件 | 显卡 |</code></pre><p>效果：</p><table><thead><tr><th>名称</th><th>类型</th><th>描述</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>CPU</td><td>硬件</td><td>处理器</td></tr><tr><td>GPU</td><td>硬件</td><td>显卡</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="对齐表格"><a id="对齐表格" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#对齐表格"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>对齐表格</h2><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="markdown"><code class="language-markdown">| 参数 | 值 || :--- | ---: || CPU | 32核 || 内存 | 128G |</code></pre><p>效果：</p><table><thead><tr><th style="text-align: left">参数</th><th style="text-align: right">值</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style="text-align: left">CPU</td><td style="text-align: right">32核</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align: left">内存</td><td style="text-align: right">128G</td></tr></tbody></table><hr><h1 id="10代码"><a id="10代码" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#10代码"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>10. 代码</h1><h2 id="行内代码"><a id="行内代码" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#行内代码"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>行内代码</h2><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="markdown"><code class="language-markdown">使用 `docker ps` 查看容器</code></pre><p>效果：</p><p>使用 <code>docker ps</code> 查看容器</p><h2 id="代码块"><a id="代码块" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#代码块"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>代码块</h2><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="bash"><code class="language-bash">docker psdocker images</code></pre><p>支持：</p><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="text"><code class="language-text">bashpythonjavajavascriptjsonyamlsqldockerfilexmlnginx</code></pre><hr><h1 id="11-json示例"><a id="11-json示例" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#11-json示例"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>11. JSON示例</h1><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="json"><code class="language-json">&#123;  "name": "ChatGPT",  "version": "1.0",  "enabled": true&#125;</code></pre><hr><h1 id="12-yaml示例"><a id="12-yaml示例" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#12-yaml示例"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>12. YAML示例</h1><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="yaml"><code class="language-yaml">server:  port: 8080database:  host: localhost  username: root</code></pre><hr><h1 id="13-python示例"><a id="13-python示例" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#13-python示例"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>13. Python示例</h1><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="python"><code class="language-python">def hello():    print("Hello Markdown")    hello()</code></pre><hr><h1 id="14-latex数学公式"><a id="14-latex数学公式" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#14-latex数学公式"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>14. LaTeX数学公式</h1><h2 id="行内公式"><a id="行内公式" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#行内公式"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>行内公式</h2><p class="mweb-math-inline">\(a+b=c\)</p><h2 id="独立公式"><a id="独立公式" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#独立公式"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>独立公式</h2><div class="mweb-math-block">\[E=mc^2\]</div><h2 id="复杂公式"><a id="复杂公式" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#复杂公式"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>复杂公式</h2><div class="mweb-math-block">\[\frac{-b\pm\sqrt{b^2-4ac}}{2a}\]</div><hr><h1 id="15-html"><a id="15-html" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#15-html"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>15. HTML</h1><h2 id="下划线"><a id="下划线" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#下划线"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>下划线</h2><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="html"><code class="language-html">&lt;u&gt;下划线文字&lt;/u&gt;</code></pre><h2 id="颜色"><a id="颜色" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#颜色"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>颜色</h2><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="html"><code class="language-html">&lt;span style="color:red"&gt;红色文字&lt;/span&gt;</code></pre><h2 id="居中"><a id="居中" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#居中"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>居中</h2><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="html"><code class="language-html">&lt;center&gt;居中文字&lt;/center&gt;</code></pre><hr><h1 id="16折叠内容"><a id="16折叠内容" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#16折叠内容"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>16. 折叠内容</h1><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="html"><code class="language-html">&lt;details&gt;&lt;summary&gt;点击展开&lt;/summary&gt;这里是隐藏内容&lt;/details&gt;</code></pre><p>效果：</p><details><summary>点击展开</summary><p>这里是隐藏内容</p></details><hr><h1 id="17-emoji"><a id="17-emoji" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#17-emoji"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>17. Emoji</h1><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="markdown"><code class="language-markdown">🚀 发布🔥 热门⚠️ 警告✅ 完成❌ 错误📌 注意</code></pre><hr><h1 id="18-mermaid流程图"><a id="18-mermaid流程图" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#18-mermaid流程图"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>18. Mermaid流程图</h1><div class="mermaid-wrap"><pre class="mermaid-src" hidden="">flowchart LRA[用户] --&gt; B[API网关]B --&gt; C[AI模型]C --&gt; D[返回结果]</pre></div><hr><h1 id="19-mermaid时序图"><a id="19-mermaid时序图" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#19-mermaid时序图"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>19. Mermaid时序图</h1><div class="mermaid-wrap"><pre class="mermaid-src" hidden="">sequenceDiagram用户-&gt;&gt;网关: 请求网关-&gt;&gt;模型: 转发模型--&gt;&gt;网关: 返回网关--&gt;&gt;用户: 响应</pre></div><hr><h1 id="20-mermaid架构图"><a id="20-mermaid架构图" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#20-mermaid架构图"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>20. Mermaid架构图</h1><div class="mermaid-wrap"><pre class="mermaid-src" hidden="">graph TDA[客户端]B[安全网关]C[AI模型]D[数据库]A --&gt; BB --&gt; CB --&gt; D</pre></div><hr><h1 id="21脚注"><a id="21脚注" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#21脚注"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>21. 脚注</h1><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="markdown"><code class="language-markdown">这里是一句话说明[^1][^1]: 这里是脚注内容</code></pre><hr><h1 id="22锚点跳转"><a id="22锚点跳转" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#22锚点跳转"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>22. 锚点跳转</h1><p>定义：</p><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="html"><code class="language-html">&lt;a name="top"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;</code></pre><p>跳转：</p><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="markdown"><code class="language-markdown">[返回顶部](#top)</code></pre><hr><h1 id="23键盘按键"><a id="23键盘按键" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#23键盘按键"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>23. 键盘按键</h1><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="html"><code class="language-html">&lt;kbd&gt;Ctrl&lt;/kbd&gt; + &lt;kbd&gt;C&lt;/kbd&gt;</code></pre><p>效果：</p><p><kbd>Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>C</kbd></p><hr><h1 id="24提示块"><a id="24提示块" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#24提示块"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>24. 提示块</h1><p>部分编辑器支持：</p><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="markdown"><code class="language-markdown">&gt; [!NOTE]&gt; 注意内容&gt; [!WARNING]&gt; 警告内容&gt; [!TIP]&gt; 技巧内容</code></pre><hr><h1 id="25-hexo文章模板"><a id="25-hexo文章模板" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#25-hexo文章模板"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>25. Hexo文章模板</h1><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="yaml"><code class="language-yaml">---title: 我的技术文章date: 2026-08-04categories:  - 技术tags:  - Docker  - Linuxcover: /images/demo.png---# 标题## 简介文章说明。## 环境| 软件 | 版本 ||-|-|| Ubuntu | 24.04 || Docker | 28.0 |## 安装```bashdocker pull nginx</code></pre><h2 id="架构"><a id="架构" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#架构"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>架构</h2><div class="mermaid-wrap"><pre class="mermaid-src" hidden="">flowchart LRA--&gt;B--&gt;C</pre></div><h2 id="总结"><a id="总结" class="anchor" aria-hidden="true" href="#总结"><span class="octicon octicon-link"></span></a>总结</h2><ul><li>优点</li><li>缺点</li><li>注意事项</li></ul><pre class="line-numbers" data-language="plain_text"><code class="language-plain_text">---# 常用快捷符号| 功能 | Markdown ||-|-|| 标题 | `#` || 加粗 | `**文字**` || 斜体 | `*文字*` || 删除 | `~~文字~~` || 引用 | `&gt;` || 列表 | `-` || 代码 | `` `代码` `` || 链接 | `[名称](URL)` || 图片 | `![名称](URL)` || 表格 | `|---|` || 分割线 | `---` || 任务 | `- [ ]` |</code></pre>]]></content>
      
      
